dark:text-slate-400\">A URL shortener and QR code generator with click analytics and custom aliases.</p><div class=\"mt-8 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800\"><div class=\"relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit] bg-slate-800\"><img alt=\"Shorter URLs, Instantly\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2FHotShotUI.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://8shot.example.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 px-5 py-2.5 text-[16px] font-semibold hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M320 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l82.7 0L201.4 265.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0L448 109.3l0 82.7c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32L320 0z